# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Recovered resume text. Never commit.
# These files carry names, e-mail addresses, telephone numbers, and profile
# links belonging to real job seekers. Kim et al. published hashes rather than
# text for this reason. Regenerate them locally with the scripts, and publish
# only the neutralised versions in data/processed/neutralised/.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/processed/final_with_text.csv
data/processed/final_with_text_cleaned.csv
data/processed/resumes_unique.txt

